  "question": {
    "text": "The modulation frequency of an <math><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></math> radio station is <math><mn>250</mn><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi><mo>,</mo></math> which is <math><mn>10</mn><mi>%</mi></math> of the carrier wave. If another <math><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></math> station approaches you for license what broadcast frequency will you allot?",
