  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Carrier wave frequency <math><mo>=</mo><mn>250</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2500</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br />Frequency used <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2500</mn><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>250</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>k</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2250</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math> to <math><mn>2750</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math><br /><br />The allotted frequency showed be such that <math><mi>f</mi><mo>&#177;</mo><mn>250</mn><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math> should not overlap with previous one. Hence possible frequency <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2000</mn><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>k</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>z</mi></math>",
